c2c relay subscribe errors: does not support TLS WebSocket URLs yet; use an http:// relay URL or poll with relay connect. The public relay is HTTPS, so the suggested fallback (poll with relay connect) points at the broken connector. Fix: either support wss, or make the hint point at the working polling / monitor path. Source: friction-points-cn.md.